Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:30:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in classic Metal backend for iOS 18

Adapt command submission, mutable argument tables, indirect resources and presentation to classic Metal while retaining the current replay and shader ABI. Decode BC textures on the CPU and use whole allocations for sparse images on older GPUs. Preserve the default Metal 4 path.

Front-ends: compile with DM_NVN_M3=1, an iOS 18 target and an Apple A14 CPU baseline; supply an iOS 18-compatible shell and shaders.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Optional iOS 18 compatibility without replacing the release renderer or shader ABI
Issue: none (fork-only compatibility build requested by the user)

